build.sh, make.py and ascii.txt (the ASCII faces and their names) are SebType's own, under the MIT licence in
../../LICENSE-SebType. The list they build, android/app/src/main/assets/emoji/emoji.txt, is made from
Unicode's emoji-test.txt and Unicode CLDR's annotations, under the Unicode licence (see ../../NOTICE), with
ascii.txt's faces as its last group.
